WEBVTT

00:00:00.666 --> 00:00:04.573
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> She tried to stop the car, <b>but</b> she hit the man.

00:00:06.561 --> 00:00:10.683
<b>Although</b> she tried to stop the car, she hit the man.

00:00:12.859 --> 00:00:16.093
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> She was very tired, <b>but</b> she couldn’t sleep.

00:00:18.090 --> 00:00:21.623
She couldn’t sleep, <b>although</b> she was very tired.